window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-2af90f80487bf1f4"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"clean-and-prepare-messy-data\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">清理和整理杂乱数据</h1> <p>处理表格数据，而不改动原始数据。</p> <p>拖入或提及一份杂乱的 CSV 或电子表格，说明你发现的问题， 然后请 ChatGPT 生成一份清理后的副本，同时保持原始文件不变。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>日期、货币、重复记录、汇总行或缺失值混杂的 CSV 或电子表格导出文件。</li> <li>需要处理多个来源数据的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheet</code></td> <td>检查表格文件、清理列，并生成可供检查的输出。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>清理一份副本</p> <p>建议模型：<code>gpt-6-luna</code> · 建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">清理 @marketplace-risk-rollout-export.csv。\n\n目前的问题：\n- 日期格式混用了 MM/DD/YYYY 和 YYYY-MM-DD\n- 货币值中包含 $、逗号和空白单元格\n- 重复导出产生了几行重复的客户记录\n- 地区名和类别名使用了多种别名\n- 数据中混入了粘贴过来的汇总行\n\n我希望：\n- 生成一份清理后的 CSV\n- 保持原始文件不变\n- 统一使用一种日期格式\n- 让原本为空的货币单元格继续保持为空\n- 尽可能保留来源数据的行 ID\n- 附上一份简短的数据质量说明，列出你修改、删除或无法有把握地清理的行\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-99d1e8fe39794227\">使用 ChatGPT 分析数据</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/file-inputs.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">文件输入</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">Agent 技能</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾加上 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"introduction\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">简介</h2> <p>ChatGPT 很擅长系统地清理表格数据。 如果 CSV 或电子表格中有混杂的日期格式、重复行、货币字符串、空白单元格、别名或粘贴进来的汇总行，可以请 ChatGPT 清理一份副本，并保持原始文件不变。</p> <p><a id=\"how-to-use\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">使用方法</h2> <ol> <li>将文件拖入 ChatGPT，或在提示词中提及它，例如 <code>@customer-export.csv</code>。</li> <li>说明你已经发现的问题。</li> <li>告诉 ChatGPT 清理后的版本应是什么形式：CSV、电子表格工作表，或可直接上传的文件。</li> <li>使用前，先检查清理后的副本。</li> </ol> <p>第一次清理时，可以使用本页的起步提示词。把文件名和各条要求换成你自己的情况。最有用的信息是你已经发现的问题，以及接下来需要的文件形式：清理后的 CSV、干净的电子表格工作表，或可直接上传的文件。ChatGPT 生成干净的副本后，先从聊天中打开清理后的文件和数据质量说明，再将数据用于后续处理。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"clean-and-prepare-messy-data\">Clean and prepare messy data</h1> <p>Process tabular data without affecting the original.</p> <p>Drag in or mention a messy CSV or spreadsheet, describe the problems you see, and ask ChatGPT to write a cleaned copy while keeping the original file unchanged.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>CSV or spreadsheet exports with mixed dates, currencies, duplicates, summary rows, or missing values.</li> <li>Teams who work with data from multiple sources.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheet</code></td> <td>Inspect tabular files, clean columns, and produce reviewable outputs.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Clean a Copy</p> <p>Suggested model：<code>gpt-6-luna</code> · Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Clean @marketplace-risk-rollout-export.csv.\n\nWhat's wrong:\n- dates are mixed between MM/DD/YYYY and YYYY-MM-DD\n- currency values include $, commas, and blank cells\n- a few duplicate customer rows came from repeated exports\n- region and category names use several aliases\n- there are pasted summary rows mixed into the data\n\nWhat I want:\n- write a cleaned CSV\n- keep the original file unchanged\n- use one date format\n- keep blank currency cells blank\n- preserve source row IDs when possible\n- add a short data-quality note with rows you changed, removed, or could not clean confidently\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-99d1e8fe39794227\">Analyze data with ChatGPT</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/file-inputs.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">File inputs</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">Agent skills</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"introduction\">Introduction</h2> <p>ChatGPT is great at cleaning systematically tabular data. When a CSV or spreadsheet has mixed dates, duplicate rows, currency strings, blank cells, aliases, or pasted summary rows, ask ChatGPT to clean a copy and leave the original file unchanged.</p> <h2 id=\"how-to-use\">How to use</h2> <ol> <li>Drag the file into ChatGPT or mention it in your prompt, such as <code>@customer-export.csv</code>.</li> <li>Describe the problems you already see.</li> <li>Tell ChatGPT what the cleaned version should be: CSV, spreadsheet tab, or upload-ready file.</li> <li>Review the cleaned copy before using it.</li> </ol> <p>Use the starter prompt on this page for the first cleaning pass. Replace the file name and bullets with your own. The useful details are the problems you already see and the file you need next: a cleaned CSV, a clean spreadsheet tab, or an upload-ready file. After ChatGPT writes the clean copy, open the cleaned file and the data-quality note from the chat before using the data downstream.</p>"};
